danu (1.0.1-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Windows: a surface builds without administrator rights; the squares are
    copied where Windows refuses a symbolic link (#196).
  * Windows: a rebuild no longer fails on the last build's files, which
    Windows will not remove while they are open; each build has a directory
    of its own (#197, #198).
  * A build that cannot start says why in the surface panel.

